---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import TrustStrip from '../components/TrustStrip.astro';
import CtaBlock from '../components/CtaBlock.astro';
import WhatsAppButton from '../components/WhatsAppButton.astro';
import { SITE, WA_MESSAGES } from '../lib/site';
import { organizationSchema } from '../lib/schema';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — A Small Local Team in the Centre of Cluj"
  description="localhelp.city is a small, real team in central Cluj-Napoca, led by a local PhD. We answer the everyday questions of people new to the city — on WhatsApp, in English."
  path="/about/"
  schema={[organizationSchema()]}
>
  <Hero headline="A small local team, actually in Cluj.">
    <Fragment slot="lead">
      <p>
        localhelp.city started the way most useful things do: with a problem that kept repeating.
        Our founder — a local PhD who has spent years around Cluj's universities — had helped one
        too many friends-of-friends decode a rental contract, find the right office window, or
        figure out whether a "great deal" was actually a scam.
      </p>
      <p>
        The pattern was always the same: the problem was small, the stress was big, and the
        missing ingredient was never intelligence — it was local context. So we made local
        context something you can simply ask for.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="cta">
      <WhatsAppButton message={WA_MESSAGES.general} label="Say hello on WhatsApp" variant="primary" />
    </Fragment>
  </Hero>

  <TrustStrip />

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 mt-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-terra-soft">
        {/* TODO: replace with a real team photo — natural light, the actual office, real faces */}
        <img
          src="/images/placeholder-team.svg"
          alt="Placeholder for a photo of the localhelp.city team at the office in central Cluj"
          class="w-full h-auto"
          loading="lazy"
          width="800"
          height="600"
        />
      </div>
      <PageIntro title="Who we are">
        <p>
          We're not a platform, an app, or a call center. We're a few people with an office in the
          centre of Cluj-Napoca who know this city from the inside — the universities, the
          neighborhoods, the rental habits, the good dentists, the fair prices, the shortcuts, and
          the unwritten rules that official guides never explain.
        </p>
        <p>
          When you message us, a real person who lives here reads it and answers. That's the
          entire product.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm italic">
          {/* TODO: replace with real team member names, photos, and one human line each */}
          Team introductions — names, faces, and one human line each — are coming here soon,
          along with a photo of the actual office door.
        </p>
      </PageIntro>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 mt-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <PageIntro title="How we see Cluj">
        <p>
          Not the postcard — the lived-in city. The tram at 8 a.m., the market stalls, the
          apartment-block courtyards in Zorilor and Gheorgheni, the office queues with their
          unwritten choreography, the small pleasures locals swear by in February. That's the
          Cluj we help you navigate, because it's the one you'll actually live in.
        </p>
      </PageIntro>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-terra-soft">
        {/* TODO: replace with everyday Cluj photography — tram stops, courtyards, markets */}
        <img
          src="/images/placeholder-cluj.svg"
          alt="Placeholder for everyday Cluj photography — tram stops, courtyards, markets"
          class="w-full h-auto"
          loading="lazy"
          width="800"
          height="600"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 mt-16 space-y-14">
    <PageIntro title="How we work">
      <p>
        Warm, calm, honest, practical. We tell you what's normal here, what we'd check, and what
        we'd do next — and when a question needs a professional (a lawyer, a doctor, an
        official), we say so plainly and help you find the right one. We'd rather lose a payment
        than give you a confident guess.
      </p>
      <p>
        While we're new in Cluj, early users pay what feels fair: ask a real question, use the
        answer, and choose what it was worth from a suggested range. In-person help is by the
        hour, agreed in advance.
      </p>
    </PageIntro>

    <PageIntro title="Where this is going">
      <p>
        The name is bigger than one city on purpose. More cities will come when we find local
        teams we'd trust with our own family's questions — people who know their city the way we
        know ours. Until then: Cluj, done properly.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm">
        Know someone who should run their city one day?
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-semibold text-terra-deep underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-terra">Tell us.</a>
      </p>
    </PageIntro>
  </section>

  <CtaBlock headline="The easiest way to know us is to ask us something." message={WA_MESSAGES.general} label="Ask us one question">
    <p>One question, one honest local answer. That's who we are.</p>
  </CtaBlock>
</BaseLayout>
